00:18:05.547 --> 00:18:09.900
IN CITIES LIKE VIRGINIA, EVEN IN STATES LIKE VIRGINIA

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.636
AND CITIES LIKE NORFOLK, THEY'RE REVISITING WHETHER OR

00:18:12.636 --> 00:18:17.241
NOT TO USE THIS TECHNOLOGY THEY FOUND THAT IS TRACKING PEOPLE

00:18:17.241 --> 00:18:20.845
ON THEIR WAY TO WORK IS TRACKING PEOPLE ON THEIR WAY TO

00:18:20.845 --> 00:18:25.515
SCHOOL AND IS JUST TRACKING PEOPLE GOING ON WITH THEIR

00:18:25.515 --> 00:18:28.919
DAILY BUSINESS AND FROM MY STANDPOINT I THINK THAT IS A

00:18:28.919 --> 00:18:32.456
VIOLATION OF PEOPLE'S PRIVACY REGARDLESS OF HOW VISIBLE A

00:18:32.456 --> 00:18:35.926
LICENSE PLATE IS TO EVERYONE. PEOPLE ARE BEING SURVEILLED

00:18:35.926 --> 00:18:39.797
WHEN THEY SHOULDN'T BE. SO I TRULY FEEL THAT SAFETY

00:18:39.797 --> 00:18:43.667
CANNOT COME AT THE EXPENSE OF OUR FUNDAMENTAL RIGHTS.

00:18:43.667 --> 00:18:47.805
WE CANNOT ACCEPT THE TRADEOFF WHEN SORT OF SURVEILLANCE

00:18:47.805 --> 00:18:51.808
ERODES THE VERY FREEDOMS THAT ALL OF US HERE ARE SWORN TO

00:18:51.808 --> 00:18:55.120
PROTECT. SO MY THOUGHTS ON PAUSING ARE

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:58.482
NOT ABOUT REJECTING TECHNOLOGY OUTRIGHT BUT IT IS ABOUT

00:18:58.482 --> 00:18:59.750
GETTING IT RIGHT. IT'S ABOUT ENSURING WE HAVE

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:03.888
STRICT GUARDRAILS AND INPUT FROM COMMUNITY MOVING FORWARD

00:19:03.888 --> 00:19:08.250
AND I THINK OUR POPULATION IN SAN FRANCISCO DESERVES TO

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:13.964
FEEL SAFE AND FREE BUT WE HAVE TO BE ABLE TO PROTECT PROTECT

00:19:13.964 --> 00:19:17.901
FOLKS AND ALSO HONOR THEIR PRIVATE RIGHTS.

00:19:17.901 --> 00:19:22.372
SO I CAN'T SUPPORT THIS THIS TECHNOLOGY AT THIS TIME AND I

00:19:22.372 --> 00:19:26.109
