00:20:33.177 --> 00:20:36.580
THESE DEVICES CAN HELP AS LOCATE SUSPECTS, RECOVER STOLEN

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.917
VEHICLES AND STOLEN PROPERTY AND SUPPORT THEFT ABATEMENT

00:20:39.917 --> 00:20:43.854
OPERATIONS THAT GIVES LAW ENFORCEMENT A MORE PRECISE

00:20:43.854 --> 00:20:47.258
AND LESS DANGEROUS WAY TO RESPOND IN SITUATIONS THAT

00:20:47.258 --> 00:20:48.659
MIGHT OTHERWISE LEAD TO PROLONGED PURSUITS OR BROADER

00:20:48.659 --> 00:20:51.995
RISKS TO THE PUBLIC. AT THE SAME TIME, I THINK IT IS

00:20:51.995 --> 00:20:55.199
IMPORTANT TO ACKNOWLEDGE THE PRIVACY AND CIVIL LIBERTIES

00:20:55.199 --> 00:20:56.534
CONCERNS THAT NATURALLY COME WITH ANY SURVEILLANCE

00:20:56.534 --> 00:20:59.470
TECHNOLOGY. THAT IS WHY THE GUARDRAILS HERE

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:02.876
MATTER. THE POLICY LIMITS USE TO DEFINE

00:21:02.876 --> 00:21:06.476
LAWFUL SCENARIOS. PROHIBITS USE FOR NON-LAW

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.150
ENFORCEMENT PURPOSES. PROHIBITS DISCRIMINATORY OR

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:14.150
HARASSING USE BARS USE RELATED TO ENFORCING BANS ON GENDER

00:21:14.287 --> 00:21:15.756
AFFIRMING OR REPRODUCTIVE CARE. LIMITS ACCESS TO AUTHORIZED

00:21:15.756 --> 00:21:18.756
