00:21:19.226 --> 00:21:22.896
REQUIRES TRAINING AND PROVIDES FOR OVERSIGHT AND DISCIPLINE IF

00:21:22.896 --> 00:21:26.233
THE TECHNOLOGY IS MISUSED. SO FOR ME THIS IS ABOUT

00:21:26.233 --> 00:21:27.367
BALANCE. WE SHOULD GIVE LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:21:27.367 --> 00:21:30.571
