02:58:23.840 --> 02:58:26.554
OF THE UTERUS GROWS OUTSIDE OF IT THROUGHOUT THE BODY.

02:58:26.554 --> 02:58:30.425
IT CAN CAUSE INCAPACITATING PAIN INFERTILITY, ORGAN DAMAGE,

02:58:30.425 --> 02:58:34.625
