02:58:38.834 --> 02:58:42.237
>> IT IS NOT JUST BAD OR PAINFUL PERIODS.

02:58:42.237 --> 02:58:46.240
IT IS A SYSTEMIC DISEASE THAT CAN AFFECT EVERY PART OF A

02:58:46.240 --> 02:58:50.184
PERSON'S LIFE FOR THEIR ENTIRE LIFE WITH NO KNOWN CURE.

02:58:50.184 --> 02:58:53.521
IT AFFECTS 1 IN 10 PEOPLE APPROXIMATELY 200 MILLION

02:58:53.521 --> 02:58:57.391
WORLDWIDE AND 15 MILLION IN THE UNITED STATES ALONE.

02:58:57.391 --> 02:59:00.794
>> IT IS ONE OF THE LEADING CAUSES OF SCHOOL ABSENCES

02:59:00.794 --> 02:59:01.995
